      "side": 1,
      "message": "#### **Unsafe Hotplug Registration in `ft_sg_io.c`**\n\nIn `ft_sg_open()`, you register a hotplug callback using `libusb_hotplug_register_callback()`. However, unlike `mbedtls_usb_init()` in `net_usb.c`, you do not verify if the underlying platform supports hotplug events via `libusb_has_capability(LIBUSB_CAP_HAS_HOTPLUG)`. On unsupported systems, this will silently fail or cause unpredictable behavior.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 65,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 73,
        "endChar": 2
      },
      "revId": "7c91f2c4e6dfb20882efdf316f4c04799c38715b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
